dialect protocol
protocol stdio.docx.diff
version 1
schema stdio.docx
start record

# Real binary diff frame of `../../../🧬️schema/🦀️.rs`'s `DiffCodec::encode_diff`: the `OP_BINARY_FORMAT` tag byte, then the
# UTF-8 RFC 8259 JSON of the diff's `ToValue` (the same text `print_diff` prints) running to the end of the frame.
framing record
header fixed 1
field format u8
chain payload utf8
